WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.190
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire&nbsp;
of SCP-423, the self-inserting character?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:11.130
Foundation staff snapped a picture of&nbsp;
SCP-423 using SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:16.410
while it was residing in a copy of The Eye of&nbsp;
the World by Robert Jordan. This was the result:

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:20.070
"The room is filled with books and&nbsp;
a person is reading in the corner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:25.170
although only the hands are visible from&nbsp;
behind a stack of thick leather bound volumes."

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.650
Unsurprisingly, the entity is a massive bookworm.

